From: xinwenqiang <xinwenqiang@bytedance.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Nov 2023 17:32:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] fix(ipcache): fix ipcache accidentally deleting ips that
 have been reused by new pods

